# @module examples.verify.euclid.book-i
# @means  Equal triangles on equal bases are in the same parallels.
# @from   euclid — Elements, Book I, Proposition 40
# @tier   derived
# @needs  «Geometry» «Euclid Book I» «Proposition 38: triangles on equal bases and parallels are equal»

theorem «Geometry» «Euclid Book I» «Proposition 40: equal triangles on equal bases lie between parallels» () {
    assume triangles_ABC_and_DEF_equal_on_equal_bases_BC_and_EF
    assume «Geometry» «Euclid Book I» «Proposition 38: triangles on equal bases and parallels are equal»()
    therefore lines_AD_and_EH_are_parallel_to_BC
    therefore triangles_ABC_DEF_same_parallels
}